    {
      "id": "D4",
      "summary": "A sparse index accessor decoded to all zeros. cgltf_accessor_read_index returns 0 when accessor->is_sparse or accessor->buffer_view is null, with no error channel, and ExtractMesh checked neither. GLTF-063 replaced that call with a CNA-side sparse-aware, bounds-checked index reader.",
      "owner": "GLTF-ACCESSOR",
      "owningTasks": [
        "GLTF-063"
      ],
      "closedTasks": [
        "GLTF-063"
      ],
      "remainingTasks": [],
      "firstDivergentLayer": "L3",
      "status": "fixed",
      "fixtures": [
        "sparse-indices"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D5",
      "summary": "primitive.mode was never read, so a TRIANGLE_STRIP was silently reinterpreted as a triangle list. GLTF-071 reads and classifies the mode and rejects the topologies CNA cannot yet honour; GLTF-072 still owns converting a strip to a triangle list, so the fixture does not import.",
      "owner": "GLTF-MESH",
      "owningTasks": [
        "GLTF-071",
        "GLTF-072"
      ],
      "closedTasks": [
        "GLTF-071"
      ],
      "remainingTasks": [
